{
  "contract": "place.schema.json",
  "description": "The rule of possible duplicates, computed on the device over the whole list of places, the same on the web and the phone; flagged, never blocked, never merged. Two places are possible duplicates when their names are equal once folded, or when they are less than 100 m apart (strictly). Folding: Unicode NFD, the combining marks U+0300–U+036F removed, lower case, white space trimmed and every run of white space read as one space; nothing else (« ß » stays « ß »). Distance: haversine on a sphere of radius 6 371 008.8 m. `duplicates` lists every flagged pair once, in the order of the list (the first place of the pair first), with whether the names are equal and the distance rounded to the metre (the message « Deux lieux semblent identiques : « X » et « Y », à N m l'un de l'autre. »); `flagged` lists the places that carry the pill « Doublon possible », in the order of the list.",
  "rule": {
    "thresholdMetres": 100,
    "earthRadiusMetres": 6371008.8,
    "combiningMarks": "U+0300-U+036F"
  },
